{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"Editing Cells","modules":[{"name":"Gingham"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Selection-Sorting-and-Actions","title":"Selection, Sorting and Actions","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/MenusAndActions","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyMaker"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two independent options:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/navigatesByCell","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" gives the table a focused cell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/focusedCell","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"): Left and Right move it from column to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"column, Tab and Shift-Tab too, Up and Down from row to row (selecting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row), and a click focuses the cell clicked. A ring shows it once the keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"move it; a click, Escape or the table losing the focus hide the ring.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Columns that are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/isEditable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" edit in place.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["GHTableColumn(\"name\", title: \"Name\", isEditable: true)","GHTableColumn(\"budget\", title: \"Budget\", format: .currency(code: \"USD\"), isEditable: true)","","table.navigatesByCell = true"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Ranges of cells","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Ranges-of-cells"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With navigation by cell, Shift with the arrow keys, a Shift-click or a drag","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selects a rectangle of cells from the focused cell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/selectedCellRange","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCellRange","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" of two corner cells).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Its rows are the selected rows, so the summary row’s “selected rows” scope","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers them; Copy copies the range’s cells (or just the focused cell) as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tab-separated text, which pastes into Numbers and Excel as cells; Escape","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drops the range. The corners are data source rows and column ids, so after a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sort the range spans the rows between them as shown.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Editing","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Editing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A double click on an editable cell, Return on the focused cell, or typing on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it (the text replaces the value) opens a text field over the cell. Typed keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"go to the field itself, so input methods (Japanese, Chinese, accents held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"down) compose there as in any text field; the selection keeps its focused","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"look while the cell is edited. Return","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"commits and moves down, Tab commits and moves on, Escape cancels; clicking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"elsewhere commits. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editCell(row:columnID:text:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editing from code, and so does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", as with ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSTableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedRow","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedColumn","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" tell which cell is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being edited (-1 when none; the row follows its record as rows move), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/abortEditing()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" throws the text away, e.g. before the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replaces the data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text is read by the column’s format: numbers in the user’s locale or with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"English separators (currency symbols aside, “25%” as 0.25 in percent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"columns), dates for date columns, text otherwise; an empty field is ","type":"text"},{"code":".empty","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Text that isn’t a number where one is due changes nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The data source receives the value, like ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSTableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"tableView(_:setObjectValue:for:row:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func tableView(_ tableView: GHTableView, setValue value: GHCellValue, for column: GHTableColumn, row: Int) {","    switch (column.id, value) {","    case (\"name\", .text(let name)): campaigns[row].name = name","    case (\"budget\", .number(let budget)): campaigns[row].budget = budget","    default: break","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The table then reads the row again (its summaries, filter, sort and groups","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"follow), and registers the change with the window’s undo manager: Undo sets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the old value back through the same method. The delegate’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableViewDelegate\/tableView(_:shouldEdit:row:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can keep a cell from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being edited.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Check boxes and lists","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Check-boxes-and-lists"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean cells of an editable column show a check box. A click on the box","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toggles it (and selects the row), as do Space on the focused cell, Return and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a double click. A column with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" edits in a menu","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of those values instead of a text field: Return or a double click opens it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"under the cell, with the current value checked (typing doesn’t). Both reach","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the data source and Undo the same way as text:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["GHTableColumn(\"autoBid\", title: \"Auto bid\", alignment: .center, isEditable: true)","GHTableColumn(\"status\", title: \"Status\", isEditable: true, editChoices: [","    .tags([GHTag(\"Active\", color: .green)]),","    .tags([GHTag(\"Paused\", color: .gray)]),","])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Menu items show the values as the column displays them, tags with their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"color.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Ratings","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Ratings"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An editable column of ","type":"text"},{"code":".rating","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values is edited without a field: a click on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a star sets it, just before the first one clears it, and a number key sets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the focused cell (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/DisplayingValues","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Choices that open on a click","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Choices-that-open-on-a-click"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every cell of an editable column with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" shows a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pop-up button’s up-down chevron at its trailing edge, so it reads as a menu","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it’s clicked. Set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/opensChoicesOnClick","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to open the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"menu on a single click (selecting the row too), like an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPopUpButton","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cell; otherwise it opens on a double click or Return.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gingham\/editingcells"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Let users move from cell to cell with the keyboard and edit values in place,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"like a spreadsheet.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/EditingCells"},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCollationKeyProvider":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCollationKeyProvider"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCollationKeyProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcollationkeyprovider","title":"GHCollationKeyProvider","abstract":[{"text":"Makes collation keys for the table’s text sorts (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"GHTableView.collationKeyProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/abortEditing()":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"abortEditing","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/abortEditing()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/abortediting()","title":"abortEditing()","abstract":[{"text":"Ends editing and throws the text away, like ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSControl","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"abortEditing()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on an NSTableView: the cell keeps its value and the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"table takes the keyboard. Returns whether a cell was being edited.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/editedRow":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"editedRow","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedRow","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/editedrow","title":"editedRow","abstract":[{"text":"The data source row whose cell is being edited in a text field, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"-1, like NSTableView’s: it follows the record as rows move.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/focusedCell":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/focusedcell","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"focusedCell","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GHCellPosition","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham14GHCellPositionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The cell the keyboard acts on, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"navigatesByCell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (drawn with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ring), or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kept by row handle, so it stays on its record as live updates insert,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remove and move rows (a removed record’s cell is no longer focused).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"focusedCell","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/focusedCell","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/tableColumns":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/tableColumns","title":"tableColumns","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/tablecolumns","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every leaf column, hidden ones included, like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSTableView.tableColumns"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the order of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"columns"},{"text":" (the user’s moves change it; frozen columns","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show in their region whatever their place here). Column indexes of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"API refer to it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tableColumns"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham13GHTableColumnV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GHTableColumn"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableColumn/editChoices":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtablecolumn\/editchoices","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"editChoices","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GHCellValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham11GHCellValueO"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The values an editable column’s cells choose from, in a menu instead","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of a text field (e.g. statuses as tags), or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Editable Boolean","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cells show a check box without them.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"editChoices","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/navigatesByCell":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/navigatesbycell","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the keyboard moves a focused cell (","type":"text"},{"code":"focusedCell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") instead of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whole rows: Left and Right go from column to column, Tab and Shift-Tab","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"too, Up and Down from row to row; a click focuses the cell clicked.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Editable cells edit on Return, a double click or typing.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"navigatesByCell","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/navigatesByCell","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"navigatesByCell"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/editcolumn(_:row:with:select:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Starts editing a cell by column index, like NSTableView’s: ","type":"text"},{"code":"select","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selects the text, otherwise the caret goes after it. The event is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored (the text field takes the clicks). Unlike NSTableView, the row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needn’t be selected.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"editColumn","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"row","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSEvent","text":"NSEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"select"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A fast table for business data on the Mac, iPad and iPhone: frozen columns,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"column groups, a summary row with formulas, row grouping with subtotals, search and filters, stable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"selection across reloads, and live updates.","type":"text"}],"title":"Gingham","role":"collection"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTextKeys":{"role":"symbol","title":"GHTextKeys","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Collation keys made by Gingham itself, without ICU: the table’s text sorts"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use them unless an app sets another provider (or none) in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/collationKeyProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/editCell(row:columnID:text:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/editcell(row:columnid:text:)","abstract":[{"text":"Starts editing a cell, like NSTableView’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a text field over the cell with its value as displayed (","type":"text"},{"code":"text","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" replaces","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it, e.g. what the user started typing). Returns whether editing began.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"editCell(row:columnID:text:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editCell(row:columnID:text:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"editCell","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"row","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"columnID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCollationKeyMaker":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCollationKeyMaker"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCollationKeyMaker"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyMaker","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcollationkeymaker","title":"GHCollationKeyMaker","abstract":[{"text":"Makes the collation keys of texts on one thread.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/DisplayingValues":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/DisplayingValues","title":"Displaying Values","abstract":[{"text":"Return typed values from the data source and let columns format them;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pictures and videos are values too.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/displayingvalues","kind":"article","role":"article"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/SelectionAndSorting":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/selectionandsorting","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Keep the selection on the same records, react to it, and sort when the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"clicks a header.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","title":"Selection and Sorting"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/collationKeyProvider":{"role":"symbol","title":"collat